<前言><![CDATA[]]></前言>
<法規內容>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 1</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[The Standards are prescribed in accordance with the provision of Article 17 of the Act Governing Food Safety and Sanitation.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 2</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[Contaminants as referred to these standards shall mean the substance not intentionally added to food, which present in food as a result of production or pollution during the manufacturing, processing, preparing, packaging, transportation, storage, or selling, or as a result of environmental contamination, but do not include insect fragments, hairs and other extraneous foreign matters.
Toxins as referred to these standards including the mycotoxins, marine bio-toxins and natural toxins in plant origin.
The scope of these standards does not include the residues of pesticides, veterinary drugs and processing aids; the tolerance of atomic dust and radioactivity contamination, polychlorinated biphenyl and dioxins; and the microorganisms and microbial toxins that are within the Sanitation Standards for Microorganisms in Foods.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 3</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[The maximum levels of metals in foods shall meet the standards in Annex table 1.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 4</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[The maximum levels of mycotoxins in foods shall meet the standards in Annex table 2.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 5</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[The maximum levels of other contaminants and toxins in foods shall meet the standards in Annex table 3.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 6</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[The Standards shall be implemented on January 1, 2019.
The promulgation of amended Appendix 1 to Article 3, Appendix 2 to Article 4, Appendix 3 to Article 5 on June 17, 2020 shall be implemented on January 1, 2021.
The promulgation of amended Appendix 3 to Article 5 on February 4, 2021 shall be implemented on July 1, 2021.
The promulgation of amended Appendix 3 to Article 5 on May 31, 2022 shall be implemented on July 1, 2024.
The promulgation of amended Appendix 1 to Article 3 on March 28, 2024 shall be implemented on July 1, 2024.
The promulgation of amended Appendix 1 to Article 3 on November 28, 2024 shall be implemented on January 1, 2026.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
</法規內容>
